      "statement": "Task.apply_async delegates to Celery.send_task (or runs the task inline via apply when task_always_eager is set), and send_task routes the message, builds a protocol-2 message with as_task_v2 and publishes it through a pooled producer, then returns an AsyncResult with the task id.",
