      "id": "claim_880e8b6905ad44c097fa0faa5f276366",
      "statement": "Protocol 2 task messages carry task metadata in headers (id, task, eta, expires, group, retries, timelimit, root_id, parent_id, stamps) and a body of (args, kwargs, {callbacks, errbacks, chain, chord}); the task id is also the correlation_id and reply_to carries the client's result queue.",
